	"data": "Concept: Cybernautics Vision\n\nWhat It Is\ncithoreal's long-term vision: personal infrastructure tools built for himself that eventually become shareable products. The homelab is the proving ground; the products are the extrapolation.\n\n\"My Solid pod is my Cybership\" — decentralized data sovereignty as the north star.\n\nWhy It Matters\nEverything in the homelab is a prototype of something that could exist for others. The audio journal pipeline, the inventory app, the skill trees — they're all…",
